  "details": "I just created a group literally minutes ago and all of a sudden it locked me out from editing it. My own group put me in member mode after creation confirmation, and I’m unable to fix/edit the group. The general selection is not available to access. I’ve already tried contacting the VRChat Discord with limited resources. \n\nTurning on 2FA in your group under Owner just kicks you out and relabels you as a member. I’m unable to delete the group. :(\n\nGenuinely, this feature should be removed if it’s gonna cause problems for Group Owners.",
